    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45120</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_165_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Couleur&gt;、だいぶ
魔物を捕獲し慣れてきたよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Seems like you've gotten used
to capturing monsters, huh, &lt;Couleur&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45184</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_165_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>クルール！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45304</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_165_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>これならよっぽど強敵でもない限り、
バンバン捕まえたりできるのかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Except for maybe the very strongest ones,
you could probably catch any monster now!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45368</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_165_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>クルール！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45472</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_165_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>こらーっ、&lt;Dio&gt;！
夕飯の食材、つまみ食いしない！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, &lt;Dio&gt;! Don't eat all of
our ingredients before dinner!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45552</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_165_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ケチっ！　ちょっとだけだろ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's the big deal? It was a snack!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45616</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_165_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>クルール！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45676</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_165_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>え……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45736</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_165_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45832</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_165_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>って、うおっ！　なんだこれ！？　&lt;Couleur&gt;！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wh-What the hell is this!? &lt;Couleuru&gt;!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45920</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_165_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>オレは魔物じゃないっての！　こら！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm not a friggin' monster! Let me out!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45992</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_165_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うへー、べとべと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ugh... So sticky...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
